  "summary": "Both PopPert and SCALE address the challenge of predicting transcriptional responses from unpaired single-cell populations, leveraging population-level joint distribution modeling and conditional transport to enable perturbation-specific predictions across different types of perturbations. Sickle-cell disease linked to prematurely aged stem cells in mice, while geological rifts on Venus could indicate ongoing tectonic activity, and nuclear-powered ships face regulatory challenges.",
